# Pantheon Properties — redirects from the old WordPress site
#
# Format: <old path>  <new path>  <status>
# Rules are checked top to bottom; the first match wins, so keep specific
# rules above wildcard (*) rules. Trailing slashes don't matter.
# Pages that exist on the new site (e.g. /property/401-penhorn-avenue/)
# are never affected by these rules.

# --- 1. Hacked spam pages: 410 Gone -------------------------------------
# Tells Google these pages were removed on purpose so it drops them from
# search results. Visitors see the normal "Page not found" page.
# /news/ only ever listed these spam posts, so it is removed too.
/australian-pokies-at-casino-2024/*          /404.html  410
/hack-au-pokies-2024/*                       /404.html  410
/win-cash-safe-pokies/*                      /404.html  410
/free-winning-pokies-machines/*              /404.html  410
/tax-free-pokies-with-bonus-that-pay-cash/*  /404.html  410
/popular-pokies-tricks-to-win/*              /404.html  410
/batman-hill-pokies/*                        /404.html  410
/real-money-pokies-2024/*                    /404.html  410
/aus-money-accepted-aristocrat-pokies/*      /404.html  410
/slot-machines-in-anaheim-au/*               /404.html  410
/news/*                                      /404.html  410

